Preparing for your annual physical is a great step in managing your health proactively. Given your medical history, you have several interconnected conditions (atrial fibrillation, sleep apnea, hypertension, and retinopathy) that require careful coordination. 

*(Note: You mentioned your last blood pressure was "1.2" — this is likely a typo, perhaps meaning 120/80 or 120-something. You'll want to clarify this number before your appointment!)*

Here is a structured list of questions you can take with you to discuss with Dr. Sarah Chen:

