* "I am currently taking apixaban (5mg twice daily) and metoprolol (25mg). Are these still the optimal medications and dosages for my AFib?"
* "Are there any new guidelines, alternative treatments, or lifestyle adjustments I should be aware of for managing AFib?"
* "How is my sleep apnea impacting my AFib? Is there anything more we should be doing to manage the sleep apnea to reduce stress on my heart?"

