* "Given my age (60), AFib, sleep apnea, and history of retinopathy, do you think my case is complex enough to warrant a referral to a specialist at Colorado Cardiology?"
* "What specific signs, symptoms, or test results would indicate that I need to transition my cardiovascular care to a dedicated cardiologist rather than managing it here in primary care?"

### 4. Preventative Care & Routine Screenings
* "Do I need a referral to an ophthalmologist for a follow-up eye exam regarding my retinopathy?"
* "Are there any other routine screenings or blood tests (such as a comprehensive metabolic panel, cholesterol/lipid panel, or kidney function tests) we should run today, especially since I am on apixaban?"

